OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge working hard on room
OL,4,Asecurity, says CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe interim chief executive of
OL,7,FTravelodge has told the BBC "nobody is
OL,8,Fworking harder on security of rooms in
OL,9,Fthis industry than we are today".
OL,11,FIt comes after a damning review found
OL,12,Fguests were still not as safe as they
OL,13,Fshould be, with room intrusions
OL,14,Freported at nearly one-in-10 Travelodge
OL,15,Fhotels this summer, and no policy in
OL,16,Fplace on violence against women and
OL,17,Fgirls.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
