OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge working hard on room
OL,4,Asecurity, says CEO
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterim CEO Ray Reidy said the chain
OL,7,Fhas made a "number of changes" since an
OL,8,Fattack at its Maidenhead hotel in
OL,9,FDecember 2022 became national news
OL,10,Fearlier this year.
OL,12,FHe said the woman was a victim of a
OL,13,F"heinous crime", adding: "We are
OL,14,Fdesperately sorry that she didn't get
OL,15,Fthe protection that she deserved."
